# Stepping and the Call Stack. Set a breakpoint on "jal outer", then:
# - Step Over (F10) runs the whole call and stops on the yield.
# - Step Into (F11) goes into outer: the Call Stack shows "outer (returns to ...)"
#   above the chip. Step Into "jal inner" for a third frame.
# - Step Out (Shift+F11) leaves inner, then outer.
# "jal countdown" calls itself. A breakpoint on "pop ra" with the condition
# Depth == 0 shows a frame for each level. Step Over a "jal countdown" from
# the top and it stops after all of them have returned.
alias Depth r0
alias Result r1
start:
move Depth 3
jal countdown
move Result 0
jal outer
yield
j start

countdown:
push ra
sub Depth Depth 1
blez Depth countdownDone
jal countdown
countdownDone:
pop ra
j ra

outer:
push ra
jal inner
add Result Result 1
pop ra
j ra

inner:
add Result Result 10
j ra
